TI  - Bronchial cast: a case report.
PG  - 242-4
LID - 10.1007/s12070-008-0049-2 [doi]
AB  - We present a case of a child who presented with respiratory distress mimicking 
      foreign body aspiration which was treated by bronchoscopic extraction of 
      bronchial cast. Early interventional bronchoscopy in management of plastic 
      bronchitis, though difficult, provides an immediate benefit and good prognosis 
      especially in patients with no underlying cardiopulmonary morbidity.
